NAME
     vmstat - what the machine is doing, sampled

SYNOPSIS
     vmstat [DELAY [COUNT]]
     iostat [DELAY [COUNT]]
     mpstat [DELAY [COUNT]]

DESCRIPTION
     vmstat prints a line of counters -- processes, memory, block I/O,
     interrupts, context switches, processor time -- every DELAY seconds.
     Called as iostat it prints the disks, and as mpstat the processors.

SEE ALSO
     free(1), top(1), dmesg(1)
